ALTER TABLE flights ADD COLUMN act_arr_time_formatted text;

UPDATE flights SET
    act_arr_time_formatted =
        CASE
            WHEN LEFT(act_arr_time, 2) IN ('12', '00') THEN RIGHT(act_arr_time, 5) || ' PM'
            ELSE act_arr_time || ' AM'
        END;
```

3. Group the flights by airline carrier and count the number of on-time arrivals (flights where act_dep_time is before or equal to act_arr_time_formatted).

```sql
SELECT carrier, COUNT(*) as num_on_time
FROM flights
WHERE CAST(act_dep_time AS TIME) <= CAST(act_arr_time_formatted AS TIME)
